      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "陛下、ありがとうございます！\n子供たちも陛下の優しさに触れて喜んでいました。\nお心遣いに、兵士の士気も高まることでしょう。\n引き続き、本国の守りはお任せくださいませ。",
        "official_en": "Thank you, Your Majesty! The children were moved\nby your kindness. Your considerate gesture will\nbolster the soldiers' morale as well. I shall continue\nto faithfully manage our kingdom's protection.",
